  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b65d79f86c3c1766",
      "translationZh": "“数据工作中一个非常重要的部分不仅仅是进行分析，还包括传达它，” says Caitlin Colgrove, co-founder and CTO of Hex, an agentic data platform. But according to Caitlin, “模型在数据可视化方面已经挣扎了很长时间。” GPT‑6 Astra changes that.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a986813dad03f79",
      "translationZh": "“借助 GPT‑6 Astra，您能够构建更加复杂、交互式、引人注目且美观的数据工件，这些工件不仅能够清晰地传达您的分析，而且您实际上会感到自豪而在组织内部共享。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d35136cdfb0268cc",
      "translationZh": "—Caitlin Colgrove, 联合创始人兼 CTO, Hex",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c371f114e54c9de0",
      "translationZh": "处理清晰可视化背后的复杂性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90cf1008340b9a60",
      "translationZh": "制作有用的数据可视化既需要技术工作，也需要关于如何呈现结果的选择。Caitlin 指出 GPT‑6 Astra 与底层库配合得很好，并执行所需的数据转换，帮助分析师创建功能强且视觉吸引力的输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cfdd00a77d58b6b",
      "translationZh": "“Astra 能够进入底层库，完成地理空间可视化所需的所有复杂转换，并构建出不仅功能完善而且美观的数据工件。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "856618fc8e7cbf6e",
      "translationZh": "例如，Hex 用户可以询问销售渠道随时间的表现情况，哪些表现最好，哪些应该被停用。Hex 将书面发现与趋势线和比较并列展示，此外还提供交互式仪表盘，让用户可以探索关键指标、排名和地理细分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3e19c6ed0b7bd976",
      "translationZh": "确保每个答案都合理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
